```

### Exporter Patterns

```perl
package MyApp::Util;
use v5.36;
use Exporter 'import';

our @EXPORT_OK   = qw(trim);
our %EXPORT_TAGS = (all => \@EXPORT_OK);

sub trim($str) { $str =~ s/^\s+|\s+$//gr }

1;
```

## Tooling

### perltidy Configuration (.perltidyrc)

